  "notes": [
    "Independently read all six production TypeScript files and both metadata files. All 16 files under the plugin root are partitioned into reviewed or excluded records. No declaration files or ambiguous test-only helpers are present.",
    "All production relative imports remain within extensions/geolocation. package.json declares index.ts as its sole extension entry, maxmind as an installed dependency, and no build-output exception. The shared tsconfig is compiler configuration only; no additional shared shipped source is included. Installed dependencies and SDK implementation dependencies are not recursively audited.",
    "Confirmed HEAD and plugin production/metadata contents match the pinned commit. Root, extensions, src/plugins and src/plugin-sdk AGENTS.md were read; observed authorized instruction/skill work elsewhere is outside this audit.",
    "Public package exports and focused SDK facades establish all ten exact module specifiers and thirteen original exports. OpenClawPluginApi has an explicit type import/reference; the plugin-entry module is mixed because definePluginEntry is ordinarily imported at the entrypoint.",
